# Taskboard

Tracks in-flight work on this package. One board per branch's worth of work;
finished sections stay for the record until the branch merges.

## Feat: BCAccordion (`feat/accordion`)

Port of heroui-native's Accordion
(<https://heroui.com/en/docs/native/components/accordion>), from
`heroui-native/src/components/accordion/` + `src/primitives/accordion/`.

