### Notes

- `BCMotion` already carried `accordionSpring` (m4/k1600/d140),
  `accordionIndicatorSpring` (m4/k1000/d140) and
  `accordionContentFadeDuration` (200ms) before this work started.
- The chevron rotates **-180°** (`-0.5` turns). `INDICATOR_ROTATION` in
  upstream's `accordion.constants.ts` says `+180deg` but is dead code —
  the live value is `[0, -180]` in `accordion.animation.ts`.
- Collapsing uses `animateBackWith`, not `animateWith`: the latter forces
  `_direction = forward`, so `isDismissed` never becomes true and the
  content would never unmount.
- The expanded flag reaches the indicator and content through an
  `InheritedWidget`, so the springs are kicked from `didChangeDependencies`,
  not the house `didUpdateWidget` idiom.
- Known showcase-harness quirk, not a component bug: `UsageVariantPageView`
  reserves 96px at the bottom while a 7-entry pagination rail is ~400px tall,
  so tall variant content paints under the rail labels. Every screen with
  many variants behaves this way.

